  "title": "Tangy Bar-B-Que Sauce",
  "description": "This BBQ sauce is tangy, but it 's also sweet and has a nice taste of onion and garlic. It coats chicken or beef beautifully and also makes a great sauce to serve in small bowls for dipping.",
